1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,200
Hi, I am Muhammad Danish Alif Bin Azrul,

2
00:00:03,240 --> 00:00:05,900
I am from Universiti Teknologi PETRONAS,

3
00:00:05,940 --> 00:00:08,370
and this is INSIGHTAID AI.

4
00:00:17,770 --> 00:00:19,340
Six thirty in the morning.

5
00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:21,440
A koperasi manager has to decide

6
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:24,310
how much nasi lemak to make today.

7
00:00:24,730 --> 00:00:28,190
Make too much, and it goes in the bin.

8
00:00:28,230 --> 00:00:31,920
Make too little, and students leave hungry.

9
00:00:32,340 --> 00:00:35,780
And customers are already saying what went wrong,

10
00:00:35,820 --> 00:00:37,670
in three languages.

11
00:00:38,090 --> 00:00:41,520
Business intelligence tools are expensive,

12
00:00:41,730 --> 00:00:44,970
feedback arrives in Bahasa Melayu, English and Mandarin,

13
00:00:45,010 --> 00:00:50,460
and most owners only react after the damage is done.

14
00:00:53,420 --> 00:00:56,780
INSIGHTAID AI turns sales and customer reviews

15
00:00:56,820 --> 00:01:01,330
into daily decisions. You can try it right now:

16
00:01:01,580 --> 00:01:03,590
no account, one click.

17
00:01:04,010 --> 00:01:09,000
Every visitor gets a private copy of Koperasi Siswa Maju,

18
00:01:09,050 --> 00:01:11,760
a fictional campus cooperative.

19
00:01:12,230 --> 00:01:15,700
Its data is synthetic, and the app says so.

20
00:01:16,120 --> 00:01:19,390
Sales and reviews go through the same pipeline

21
00:01:19,640 --> 00:01:23,450
a real upload would. Nothing is pre-baked.

22
00:01:23,870 --> 00:01:27,830
This is the Prep and Stock Planner. For tomorrow,

23
00:01:27,870 --> 00:01:31,000
it says how much of each item to prepare.

24
00:01:31,420 --> 00:01:35,370
Not a black box: every number shows its reason.

25
00:01:35,460 --> 00:01:39,950
Expected sales come from the same weekday over four weeks,

26
00:01:40,180 --> 00:01:43,370
plus a safety buffer the manager controls.

27
00:01:43,790 --> 00:01:47,620
More buffer means fewer sold-out items,

28
00:01:47,870 --> 00:01:51,200
but more risk of waste. He decides.

29
00:01:51,620 --> 00:01:55,470
And this is where customer voice meets the kitchen.

30
00:01:55,660 --> 00:01:58,770
Recent reviews called the karipap "basi",

31
00:01:58,880 --> 00:02:02,180
so the planner flags it, cuts the batch,

32
00:02:02,220 --> 00:02:03,770
and says why.

33
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:06,850
INSIGHTAID reads customer opinion

34
00:02:06,890 --> 00:02:10,230
in Bahasa Melayu, English and Mandarin,

35
00:02:10,270 --> 00:02:12,500
including mixed sentences.

36
00:02:12,920 --> 00:02:16,640
When complaints suddenly rise, it raises an alert

37
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:19,610
and shows the evidence behind it.

38
00:02:20,030 --> 00:02:23,160
Recommendations come from clear rules.

39
00:02:23,250 --> 00:02:27,080
The AI only explains them in plain language.

40
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:33,970
Does it help? We replayed four weeks two ways.

41
00:02:34,020 --> 00:02:37,520
Waste fell from nine hundred and fifty-one ringgit

42
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:40,730
to four hundred and ninety-nine ringgit,

43
00:02:40,770 --> 00:02:43,320
forty-seven point six percent less,

44
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:46,750
in a simulation on synthetic data.

45
00:02:47,170 --> 00:02:49,660
We show the trade-off too:

46
00:02:50,050 --> 00:02:52,520
it ran out of stock more often.

47
00:02:52,830 --> 00:02:55,740
The buffer is how he balances it.

48
00:02:56,160 --> 00:02:58,580
We set our targets before building anything,

49
00:02:58,620 --> 00:03:02,310
and we publish every result, including the misses.

50
00:03:02,730 --> 00:03:07,550
Our multilingual model reached eighty-four point one percent accuracy

51
00:03:07,590 --> 00:03:10,150
on over ten thousand test comments,

52
00:03:10,190 --> 00:03:13,080
above target in all three languages.

53
00:03:13,500 --> 00:03:17,730
Every analysis page loads in under three seconds.

54
00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:21,160
Our sales forecast met its accuracy target

55
00:03:21,200 --> 00:03:25,310
in one of three tests, and we say so.

56
00:03:27,630 --> 00:03:30,560
The model is simple: free to start,

57
00:03:30,600 --> 00:03:33,310
forty-nine ringgit a month for the full toolkit,

58
00:03:33,350 --> 00:03:36,150
and plans for multi-outlet operators.

59
00:03:36,780 --> 00:03:40,850
It runs on free-tier cloud and open-source models,

60
00:03:41,060 --> 00:03:42,740
so it stays affordable,

61
00:03:42,780 --> 00:03:46,310
and anyone can try it before signing up.

62
00:03:46,930 --> 00:03:51,030
Our next step is a pilot with a real campus cooperative,

63
00:03:51,070 --> 00:03:54,340
then koperasi networks across Malaysia.

64
00:03:55,030 --> 00:03:59,120
INSIGHTAID AI won a Silver Award at AIMIX IID 2026,

65
00:03:59,160 --> 00:04:01,370
and this is only the start.

66
00:04:03,690 --> 00:04:07,060
The software is the author's own work,

67
00:04:07,210 --> 00:04:08,460
all rights reserved.

68
00:04:08,880 --> 00:04:12,930
A koperasi manager doesn't need a data scientist.

69
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:16,910
He needs to know what to cook tomorrow, and why.

70
00:04:17,020 --> 00:04:19,350
That's what INSIGHTAID AI does.

71
00:04:19,770 --> 00:04:22,510
Scan the code and try it yourself.

72
00:04:22,550 --> 00:04:24,000
No sign-up needed.

